  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate-Smart Pacific Food Systems - Plant and Food Research (PFR) Strategic Partnership</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A long term strategic partnership with PFR to build the resilience of Pacific food systems. It will have a focus on root crops, fruit and vegetables, and includes food production, storage/ preservation and distribution. Long term outcomes includes improved food and nutritional security and livelihoods in the face of climate change.</narrative>
  </description>
